    "en": "A local rule-based natal synthesis engine. It reads the astronomical chart result, combines core placements, chart ruler, signs, houses, elements, modalities, tight aspects, retrogrades and major patterns, then ranks themes before composing a long-form report. It does not call an external AI or recalculate astronomy."
